# Brief

1. Run `selves session new "{{ '{{ dilemma }}' }}"` (or `selves session current` if it exists).
2. Run `selves recall --as now` 2-3 times to learn what present-day {{ owner }} has said.
3. Follow your SOUL.md and write `$SELVES_HOME/sessions/<id>/00_brief.md` (neutral dilemma,
   options A/B/C, stakes, deadline, what present-me has said with [YYYY-MM-DD] citations).
4. Reply `DONE chair — brief ready, session=<id>`.
